<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has extended attacks beyond Myanmar, bombing a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and striking Karen positions in Mae Hong Son while blaming resistance fire from Thailand. Resistance forces used drones to hit a Christian Bible school, killing three female students, and an airstrike on a residence in Mrauk-U killed a pregnant woman and injured ten civilians. The military is proceeding with April parliamentary by-elections in conflict-hit Sagaing, Chin and Shan, expanding voting to areas of ongoing fighting. Dead Starlink terminals are being repurposed to locate and kill people. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNZVJZN3pQLTFLRllYeDJQbi1IeHlheFYzZDlRczVMVklsdmZPdVIwUXpEVVdNbXJxX3FQbVVUdnVycnk2MkY5VzJwaFhIZW5aODloeExEQ1V2ZUdnVHcxVjNZQVlvVm1OS0FGV3h6OTBjb3lsakVRZ244OEZ3b1NpU3NWcUEtcHdwM1JrcVo0TjBSVVhIVVEwRUhVRGEtYVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOZGgtWXJTWl9tbjhEU1lyY19OS0VoUkZjV1JNdjdXbDdPV3NUa2dGTzlETXVaTmJpRWpqa2NNdkQwcXpvTGktY2lWb0FWZE5HYkt6ZTQ5Sjd3MEl1RUhFcTRYaEtzYkNVUUlTX3VoSWxTbUxCYUlfZUJxLVFoY1ZRUF9xVnRSTEs2Tkx0cl8tdjFWSkRBTGw5WHhOSXJPdkpXNUVuZg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNaTRENW4wc3Y4LV84U2oteDM2UlBVZXM3WGtrM0FBRXFROWhoTE5pSTIycmFFWUpKQlpwM0pBdXdEZTJMbVJnS3FPTmYzNjJsclNRNkpQQnNsdEYwTVByR3U5MmdRV09Pck1qUWRnR1h0ODZtV3UzcnNoM0I4VkdUY3RnQ0ppdGc3QmNuQVVDamN3ZHF1MXV1eS1BNzdmWXNtOC16UmhPSEJTNXAwNXJmdDQ3QnlVMFRRQjh2eFp0YXQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Irrawaddy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOcjFRM21fRl9sQT